  "posted_text": "🏢 NJ S4390 — NJ Limits AI Data Center Tax Credits\n\nNew Jersey is capping tax credits for the Next New Jersey Program. Specifically, the bill sets a $250 million limit on tax credits available for projects related to artificial intelligence or data centers. This reallocation aims to direct funds towards energy storage projects and provides a one-time gross income tax credit for lower-income residential electric customers. ...\n...",
